12. Pilot and phased deployment can reduce operational risk.
13. Maintenance windows help minimize business disruption.
14. Critical systems should have appropriate recovery/rollback planning.
15. Backups should be tested, not merely created.
16. After patching, verify the installation.
17. **Rescanning confirms whether the vulnerability was actually remediated.**
18. Patch compliance measures how well systems meet patch requirements.
19. MTTP = Mean Time to Patch.
20. MTTR = Mean Time to Remediate.
21. Unsupported/EOL software creates increased security risk.
22. Applications and third-party dependencies also require patch management.
23. Firmware may require security updates too.
24. Zero-day vulnerabilities may not have an available vendor patch.
